<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">It is quite funny that PSG felt like the <=
em>good</em> guys at the Etihad Stadium but if we briefly detach ourselves =
from the notion that the European champions=E2=80=99 own sportswashing and =
cashsplashing has also done immeasurable damage to the beautiful game, then=
 <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFui=
