Bsz7RprU2e7Oc" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">their 4-2 Bigger Cup shellacking o=
f Manchester City</a> was pure cinema, baby!</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Not just because D=C3=A9sir=C3=A9 Dou=C3=
=A9 was unplayable or that Vitinha put on an absolute clinic or that Luis E=
nrique was more forward-thinking than Magnus Carlsen reading a horoscope in=
 playing his right-back as a striker, but also because the camera kept cutt=
ing =E2=80=93 deliciously =E2=80=93 to the faces of glum City fans as they =
watched their expensively assembled squad spin into such a dizzy mess that =
=C2=A3125m Enzo Fern=C3=A1ndez and =C2=A3116m Elliott Anderson appeared in =
Manchester to be auditioning as a double act for <a href=3D"https://ablink.=
editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRzGmUk6O4VmuesjttiO=
p-p1kwwWHqfX_GWZf0qMgb8CgwS7cGVGBYsmR3dq43pQpg6OMMXnTE-3choxXD-pcSOQQjcrG-R=
