29/h001.6v-PDRNVczlXhZe_Y_4iw-avL0zOc7m4PcgTebDZUo8" style=3D"color: #0077B=
6;">next year=E2=80=99s Strictly</a>.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Although PSG eased off in the second half =
as City rallied to a brave 4-2 home defeat, it was a miserable outing for a=
ll of those dressed in sky blue or trendy flatcaps sitting in the stands. P=
ep Guardiola was =E2=80=93 we think =E2=80=93 not one of the City fans that=
 had spent the weekend chanting <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguar=
dian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsD=
ra0BxnPgZRI-PYlhLW9raiaxx8AW1UsiFQ6w2ZDEPO8EKd2JrBdUoLBhV_tbFvIsAKp2vdjG4cD=
