=3D"color: #0077B6;">=E2=80=9Cwe=E2=80=99re Man City, we=E2=80=99ll cheat w=
hen we want=E2=80=9D</a> at Anfield =E2=80=93 but the former manager return=
ed to Manchester for a well-timed visit on Wednesday to support City=E2=80=
